<title>USA: Copley says judge accepts guilty plea.</title>
<headline>Copley says judge accepts guilty plea.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Copley Pharmaceutical Inc said Thursday that a federal judge has accepted the company's one-count guilty plea as part of an agreement reached with federal prosecutors on May 28.</p>
<p>As the plea agreement anticipated, the court also fined the company $10.65 million.</p>
<p>Copley had been under investigation for altering the formulation or manufacturing processes for four FDA-approved drugs and filing false reports about those products with the agency.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
